# T_SCRE: a new item refused by the server for an unknown category (the
# cursor on the field), leaving it with the discard question, then an
# item copied with Ctrl-D and the copy opened for editing, then left with
# Esc unsaved: the copy is deleted again, the list ending at item 45,
# without a note.
K INS
T ZZZ
K CTRL-S
S BADCAT
K ESC
S DISCQ
T Y
K CTRL-D
S COPY
K ESC END
S AFTERCP
K ESC
